Umbrel home-screen widgets for Kanzo.

Adds two JSON endpoints:
- GET /api/widget: task counts for Todo, Doing, Review and Done.
- GET /api/widget/projects: one row per project (up to 5) with open/done counts.

Umbrel fetches both server-side from the container, outside its app proxy.
